---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | Sarkari Sahayak 2026"
  description="Sarkari Sahayak ke baare mein jaaniye — hamara mission, team, aur kaise hum aapko sarkari kaam mein madad karte hain. Official links only policy."
  canonical="/about"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">

      <div class="section-head center-head">
        <p class="section-label">About</p>
        <h1 class="section-title">About Us</h1>
        <p class="section-sub">Sarkari Sahayak — Aapka Hindi Sarkari Guide, 2026 Edition</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>Sarkari Sahayak</strong> ek free Hindi informational guide hai jo Bharat ke nagrikon ko sarkari kaamon mein madad karta hai. Hamara maqsad hai ki har naagrik ko apne government-related kaam — jaise Aadhaar, PAN, Passport, Driving License, RBSE Board Results — ki poori jaankari <strong>apni bhasha (Hindi)</strong> mein mile, step-by-step.
        </p>

        <p>
          Hum kisi bhi sarkari ya private organization ke officially affiliated nahi hain. Yeh ek <strong>independent informational platform</strong> hai jo aapko sahi aur verified jaankari dene ki koshish karta hai.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="section-label">Mission</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:30px">Hamara Mission</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <ul>
            <li>Government services ki jaankari <strong>Hindi mein</strong> dena — simple, clear, aur step-by-step</li>
            <li>Sirf <strong>official links</strong> share karna — fake ya misleading portals se door rehna</li>
            <li>Har state ke local services ko cover karna — Rajasthan, Delhi, UP, Bihar, Maharashtra sab included</li>
            <li>Scholarship, job notifications, aur exam updates ki <strong>real-time</strong> jaankari</li>
            <li>Students ke liye Board Results, Admit Cards, aur Time Tables ka instant access</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="section-label">Team</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:30px">Hamari Team</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Humari team mein experienced web developers, content researchers, aur UI/UX designers hain jo rose naye content ko update karte hain aur aapko sahi jaankari pahunchate hain. Humari team Rajasthan, Delhi, aur other major cities se kaam karti hai.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Content Research:</strong> Har guide ke liye hum official government websites se data collect karte hain — jaise uidai.gov.in, incometax.gov.in, rbse.rajasthan.gov.in, parivahan.gov.in.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Technical Team:</strong> Humara platform modern web technologies pe built hai jo fast loading, mobile-friendly, aur accessible hai — taaki har koi, kahi bhi, asaani se access kar sake.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="section-label">What We Do</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:30px">Hum Kya Karte Hain</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Step-by-step Guides:</strong> Aadhaar update, PAN apply, Passport application — har kaam ka detailed process</li>
            <li><strong>Board Results:</strong> RBSE, CBSE, UP Board, Bihar Board — sabke results aur marksheet simulation</li>
            <li><strong>Admit Cards &amp; Time Tables:</strong> Exam hall tickets aur schedules ki turant jaankari</li>
            <li><strong>Scholarship Updates:</strong> Central aur state scholarships ke notifications aur last dates</li>
            <li><strong>Job Notifications:</strong> SSC, Railway, Banking, State PSC — sabke latest alerts</li>
            <li><strong>Rajasthan Special:</strong> SSO ID, e-Mitra, Bhu-Naksha,Jan Aadhaar — Rajasthan ke local services</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="section-label">Policy</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:30px">Official Links Only Policy</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            <strong>Sarkari Sahayak ki sabse badi priority hai aapki safety.</strong> Isliye hum sirf official government websites ke links share karte hain. Hum kisi bhi third-party portal, coaching center, ya paid service ka promotion nahi karte.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Har guide mein aapko <strong>official URL</strong> milega — direct sarkari website pe</li>
            <li>Hum <strong>kabhi bhi</strong> fake links, redirected URLs, ya shortened links use nahi karte</li>
            <li>Agar kisi guide mein koi <strong>fees</strong> mentioned hai, toh woh government website ki officially listed fees hai — hum apni taraf se koi charge nahi lagate</li>
            <li>Humara platform <strong>bilkul free</strong> hai — koi hidden charges, subscription, ya premium content nahi</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top:var(--sp-xl)">
        <span class="disc-icon">⚠️</span>
        <div class="disc-text">
          <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Sarkari Sahayak ek independent informational platform hai. Hum kisi bhi sarkari ya government body ke officially affiliated nahi hain. Yeh website kisi bhi official process ka part nahi hai.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
